WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
Pour two clear liquids side by side.

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.090
One holds dissolved sugar.

3
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.240
The other holds nothing at all.

4
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.940
To the eye, they are identical.

5
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.210
Real foods are harder still.

6
00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:17.210
One sample can hide sugar,
starch, protein and fat at once.

7
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.510
So how can a few drops of
reagent tell you which is there,

8
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.950
and how much?

9
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.030
In this mission, you'll
run the classic food tests,

10
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.300
one kind of molecule at a time.

11
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.710
Then you'll learn to read
a result as more or less,

12
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.600
not just yes or no.

13
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:37.850
Your mission: find out how a few drops of
reagent can tell you what a food contains,

14
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.920
and how much.
